<title>USA: Cymer sets two-for-one stock split.</title>
<headline>Cymer sets two-for-one stock split.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cymer Inc Thursday announced a two-for-one split of its common stock, payable Sept. 11 to shareholders on Aug. 21.</p>
<p>The stock split will increase the number of shares of common stock outstanding to about 28.5 million from about 14.25 million.</p>
